    <string name="terms_s1_title">1. What 3ditdoc does</string>
    <string name="terms_s1_body">3ditdoc is a free, offline app that lets you write, sign, add images, merge PDFs, and organize pages without touching your original file.</string>
    <string name="terms_s2_title">2. Your original file stays safe</string>
    <string name="terms_s2_body">When you open a PDF, the app only uses a temporary working copy on your phone. When you save, it creates a separate new PDF so nothing gets overwritten by mistake.</string>
    <string name="terms_s3_title">3. Your documents and signatures</string>
    <string name="terms_s3_body">You are responsible for the documents you edit, the text or images you add, and how you use visual signatures. When a document requires an official digital certificate, use a certified provider.</string>
    <string name="terms_s4_title">4. Free and straightforward</string>
    <string name="terms_s4_body">3ditdoc asks for no account, shows no ads while you work, adds no watermarks, and puts no cap on pages or files.</string>

    <string name="privacy_s1_title">1. Everything stays on your phone</string>
    <string name="privacy_s1_body">Every PDF, photo, drawing, and signature is handled strictly on your device. Nothing is ever sent to a server or cloud.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s2_title">2. No personal data collected</string>
    <string name="privacy_s2_body">3ditdoc never asks for an account, name, email, or password. There are no trackers, analytics, or hidden data sharing.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s3_title">3. Only the permissions you trigger</string>
    <string name="privacy_s3_body">• PDFs: uses Android\'s built-in file picker, reading only the files you pick.\n• Gallery: uses Android\'s Photo Picker with no broad storage access.\n• Camera: opens only when you tap "Take photo now".</string>
    <string name="privacy_s4_title">4. Temporary copies</string>
    <string name="privacy_s4_body">Working copies live only in your phone\'s temporary cache while you edit and are cleared when you close the document.</string>

    <string name="about_s1_title">Why it looks the same everywhere</string>
    <string name="about_s1_body">3ditdoc embeds real fonts and places your edits directly onto the exported PDF. What you see on your screen is the exact file that gets saved.</string>
    <string name="about_s2_title">Helpful shortcuts</string>
    <string name="about_s2_body">• Tap any item to drag, resize from the corner, or rotate.\n• Tap the eye icon at the top anytime to hide your edits and inspect the original PDF.\n• Merge PDFs or turn photos into ordered PDF pages right from the menu.</string>

